# docker build ships the whole context and ignores .gitignore, so every one of
# these has to be named again here. .cxx and the build trees are the ones that
# matter: once native code has been built locally they are gigabytes, and they
# would be uploaded on every `docker build .` to be thrown away unread.
.git
.github
.gradle
.idea
build/
app/build/
app/.cxx/
tools/bpmcheck/build/
*.apk
*.png
